OL,3,GNEWSAFire forces residents from block
OL,4,Aof flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rest centre for residents has been
OL,7,Fopened at Redbridge Primary School.
OL,8,FPeople are being urged to avoid the
OL,9,Farea around Boniface Crescent.
